{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31048","headline":"洛下寓怀 · 薛能","name":"洛下寓怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡爲遭遇孰爲官，朝野君亲各自欢。\n敢向官途争虎首，尚嫌身累爱猪肝。\n冰霜谷口晨樵远，星火炉边夜坐寒。\n唯有报恩心未剖，退居犹欲佩芄兰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}